  <entry>
    <title>VLM/VLA：部署与安全</title>
    <link href="https://charles2530.github.io/2026/04/06/ai-files-vla-deployment-and-safety/"/>
    <id>https://charles2530.github.io/2026/04/06/ai-files-vla-deployment-and-safety/</id>
